nostrils of Nidhug. Rising uncountable feet above you is the sinuous body of
the last of the great black dragons. In places you can see evidence of some of
the cataclysmic battles that have scarred his body, yet still he lives. His
head rears backwards then just as suddenly whips towards you, his mouth opening
to reveal razor sharp teeth as a huge roar shakes your very being.
